OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds more names of WW1 fallen
OL,4,Aidentified
OL,5,
OL,6,FResearchers have identified hundreds
OL,7,Fmore men associated with a town who
OL,8,Fdied in World War One, but were not
OL,9,Ffeatured on its war memorial.
OL,11,FVolunteers worked with The Dock Museum
OL,12,Fin Barrow, Cumbria, to create an
OL,13,Finteractive map of soldiers' stories
OL,14,Fand verified 885 Barrovian men among
OL,15,Fthe 886,000 British military personnel
OL,16,Fwho died in the conflict.
OL,18,FCurator Charlotte Hawley said it was
OL,19,F"considerably more" than the 583 names
OL,20,Fon the Barrow Park Cenotaph based on
OL,21,Fapplications to the council from
OL,22,Frelatives.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
