OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds more names of WW1 fallen
OL,4,Aidentified
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe told BBC Radio Cumbria that
OL,7,Ffamilies in the town were "massively
OL,8,Fimpacted" at the time, adding the map
OL,9,Fwould help people see "every man that
OL,10,Fleft the town and didn't return".
